OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 26 JAN
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Franz Xaver
OL,5,     FWolfgang Mozart
OL,6,     GDonald Macleod takes a tour of
OL,7,     Gthe early life of Franz Xaver
OL,8,     GMozart, including the complicated
OL,9,     Grelationship with his mother,
OL,10,     GConstanze.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GLive music from the Piatti
OL,13,     GQuartet.
OL,14,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,15,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,16,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,17,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,18,     GThe Ukranian pianist Vadym
OL,19,     GKholodenko performs works by
OL,20,     GBeethoven, Lyatoshinsky, and
OL,21,     GLiszt in concert at Wigmore Hall
OL,22,     Gin London.
