OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 26 JAN
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: On Disappointment
OL,5,     GRachel Cooke looks at the
OL,6,     Gdisappointments of the creative
OL,7,     Glife. Creative disappointment,
OL,8,     Gwhich often follows years of
OL,9,     Gsolitary work, is, she feels, one
OL,10,     Gof the worst kinds.
OL,11,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,12,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,13,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Geverything in between.
OL,17,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,18,     GThe in-demand rising UK trumpeter
OL,19,     GPoppy Daniels is Soweto's guest
OL,20,     Gall this week.
